// discovery/i18n-marketing.js
//
// Marketing site translation map. EN → ES pairs, keyed by the English
// source string itself so the runtime can walk visible text nodes on
// index.html and swap them directly (no data-i18n attribute required).
//
// Spanish variant: Latin American (Lima / Florida market).
//   - "ustedes" (never "vosotros") for plural-you.
//   - Industry English kept where it's the lingua franca
//     (dashboard, workflow, ERP, SAP, WhatsApp, MTD, KPI, OEE, SKU,
//      HACCP, GAP, NDF, RUL, FX, etc.).
//   - Numbers + $ amounts identical to EN. Days/weeks/hours translated.
//   - Mono labels in `// SHOUT_CASE` stay in English (system tags).
//   - Capability codes (C.01..C.04) stay identical.
//   - Sector codes (M.01..M.05, R-14, CTN-4821, BCO-1402, etc.) stay identical.
//   - Comments below ("// === SECTION ===") are stripped before parsing.
//
// Section comments mirror scroll order through index.html.

