  "Recurring processes — monthly close, reconciliation, compliance filings, alerts — declared as code-defined workflows with versioned releases, explicit retry policy, and one-command rollback. Every run is logged with input, output, duration, and operator. Spreadsheets retire. The runbook is portable: any engineering team can pick it up tomorrow.": {
    en: "Recurring processes — monthly close, reconciliation, compliance filings, alerts — declared as code-defined workflows with versioned releases, explicit retry policy, and one-command rollback. Every run is logged with input, output, duration, and operator. Spreadsheets retire. The runbook is portable: any engineering team can pick it up tomorrow.",
    es: "Procesos recurrentes — cierre mensual, reconciliación, presentaciones regulatorias, alertas — declarados como workflows definidos por código con releases versionados, política de retry explícita y rollback de un comando. Cada corrida queda registrada con input, output, duración y operador. Las hojas de cálculo se jubilan. El runbook es portátil: cualquier equipo de ingeniería puede tomarlo mañana."
  },
  "Code-defined workflow per business process": { en: "Code-defined workflow per business process", es: "Workflow definido por código, por proceso de negocio" },
  "Full audit trail on every run · input → commit": { en: "Full audit trail on every run · input → commit", es: "Audit trail completo en cada corrida · input → commit" },
  "Slack · Teams · email · dashboard outputs": { en: "Slack · Teams · email · dashboard outputs", es: "Salidas a Slack · Teams · email · dashboard" },
  "Documented runbook + freshness SLA per source": { en: "Documented runbook + freshness SLA per source", es: "Runbook documentado + SLA de frescura por fuente" },
  "Exponential backoff retry + one-command rollback": { en: "Exponential backoff retry + one-command rollback", es: "Retry con backoff exponencial + rollback de un comando" },
  "Version-controlled in git · auditor-readable": { en: "Version-controlled in git · auditor-readable", es: "Versionado en git · legible por el auditor" },
  "// CAPABILITY 03 — DEEP DIVE": { en: "// CAPABILITY 03 — DEEP DIVE", es: "// CAPABILITY 03 — DEEP DIVE" },
  "Agents in production": { en: "Agents in production", es: "Agentes en producción" },
  "Primary model · fallback Haiku": { en: "Primary model · fallback Haiku", es: "Modelo primario · fallback Haiku" },
  "Human-in-the-loop · enforced": { en: "Human-in-the-loop · enforced", es: "Human-in-the-loop · obligatorio" },
  "Each agent operates inside a defined boundary: it reads what you authorize, proposes what you allow, executes only what you have approved as automatic. Out-of-bounds requests escalate to a human owner. Every output is grounded in source data with a citation per claim — no free-form generation on operational decisions. Models swappable: claude-sonnet, claude-haiku, fallback chains by cost and latency.": {
    en: "Each agent operates inside a defined boundary: it reads what you authorize, proposes what you allow, executes only what you have approved as automatic. Out-of-bounds requests escalate to a human owner. Every output is grounded in source data with a citation per claim — no free-form generation on operational decisions. Models swappable: claude-sonnet, claude-haiku, fallback chains by cost and latency.",
    es: "Cada agente opera dentro de un perímetro definido: lee lo que ustedes autorizan, propone lo que ustedes permiten, ejecuta solo lo que ustedes aprobaron como automático. Los pedidos fuera del perímetro escalan a un dueño humano. Cada salida está anclada en los datos de origen con una cita por afirmación — nada de generación libre en decisiones operativas. Modelos intercambiables: claude-sonnet, claude-haiku, cadenas de fallback por costo y latencia."
  },
  "Trained agent on your data, policies, and history": { en: "Trained agent on your data, policies, and history", es: "Agente entrenado con sus datos, políticas e historia" },
  "Weekly executive brief · EN / ES · auditor-readable": { en: "Weekly executive brief · EN / ES · auditor-readable", es: "Brief ejecutivo semanal · EN / ES · legible por el auditor" },
  "Slack · email · WhatsApp output channels": { en: "Slack · email · WhatsApp output channels", es: "Canales de salida: Slack · email · WhatsApp" },
  "Quarterly tuning + retraining on outcomes": { en: "Quarterly tuning + retraining on outcomes", es: "Tuning + retraining trimestral sobre resultados" },
  "Citation per claim · retrieval-grounded": { en: "Citation per claim · retrieval-grounded", es: "Cita por afirmación · grounded por retrieval" },
  "Out-of-bounds requests escalate · never executed": { en: "Out-of-bounds requests escalate · never executed", es: "Los pedidos fuera del perímetro escalan · nunca se ejecutan" },
  "// CAPABILITY 04 — DEEP DIVE": { en: "// CAPABILITY 04 — DEEP DIVE", es: "// CAPABILITY 04 — DEEP DIVE" },
  "Pre-built connectors": { en: "Pre-built connectors", es: "Conectores pre-construidos" },
  "Custom connector · typical": { en: "Custom connector · typical", es: "Conector a medida · típico" },
  "KMS-managed secret vault": { en: "KMS-managed secret vault", es: "Vault de secretos gestionado por KMS" },
  "Every connector is declared as code: credentials in vault, schema documented, sync schedule explicit, error handling specified. When a source schema drifts, we know within one cycle. When a sync fails, the owner gets a Teams message — not a silent gap in the dashboard. Bilingual regulatory filings to SUNAT, SAT, and IRS. Banking, e-commerce, and ad platforms wired into one coherent fabric.": {
    en: "Every connector is declared as code: credentials in vault, schema documented, sync schedule explicit, error handling specified. When a source schema drifts, we know within one cycle. When a sync fails, the owner gets a Teams message — not a silent gap in the dashboard. Bilingual regulatory filings to SUNAT, SAT, and IRS. Banking, e-commerce, and ad platforms wired into one coherent fabric.",
    es: "Cada conector se declara como código: credenciales en vault, schema documentado, calendario de sync explícito, manejo de errores especificado. Si el schema de una fuente cambia, lo sabemos en un ciclo. Si un sync falla, el dueño recibe un mensaje de Teams — no un hueco silencioso en el dashboard. Presentaciones regulatorias bilingües a SUNAT, SAT e IRS. Bancos, e-commerce y ad platforms en un solo tejido coherente."
  },
  "API integrations to every system you use": { en: "API integrations to every system you use", es: "Integraciones por API a cada sistema que ustedes usan" },
  "Bilingual regulatory filings (SUNAT · SAT · IRS)": { en: "Bilingual regulatory filings (SUNAT · SAT · IRS)", es: "Presentaciones regulatorias bilingües (SUNAT · SAT · IRS)" },
  "Per-source freshness SLA + schema drift alerts": { en: "Per-source freshness SLA + schema drift alerts", es: "SLA de frescura por fuente + alertas de schema drift" },
  "Vaulted credentials · AES-256 · KMS · audit-logged": { en: "Vaulted credentials · AES-256 · KMS · audit-logged", es: "Credenciales en vault · AES-256 · KMS · audit-logged" },

