  "What used to require a dedicated person and days of work now happens every time you open the dashboard. The same data, the same definition, accessible to every role.": { en: "What used to require a dedicated person and days of work now happens every time you open the dashboard. The same data, the same definition, accessible to every role.", es: "Lo que antes requería una persona dedicada y días de trabajo ahora pasa cada vez que abren el dashboard. La misma data, la misma definición, accesible para cada rol." },
