  "Repetitive tasks that used to consume your people — building reports, reconciling Excels, chasing information — now run themselves.": { en: "Repetitive tasks that used to consume your people — building reports, reconciling Excels, chasing information — now run themselves.", es: "Las tareas repetitivas que consumían a su gente — armar reportes, reconciliar Excels, perseguir información — ahora corren solas." },
