  "Early alerts convert problems into notices. What used to be discovered at close, you now see while there's still time to correct.": { en: "Early alerts convert problems into notices. What used to be discovered at close, you now see while there's still time to correct.", es: "Las alertas tempranas convierten problemas en avisos. Lo que antes se descubría al cierre ahora se ve cuando todavía hay tiempo de corregir." },
